flowchart TB
    U[User Input] --> O[Orchestrator]
    D[Retrieved Documents] --> R[Retriever]
    M[Memory] --> O
    R --> C[Context Packet]
    C --> L[LLM]
    L --> S[Safety Layer]
    S --> T[Tools]
    T --> SYS[Systems of Record]
    S --> OBS[Observability and Replay]

    U -. untrusted .-> O
    D -. untrusted until verified .-> R
    M -. scoped .-> O
    T -. side effects .-> SYS
